#. やはり、ここの窓も…
#. 鉄板で封じられているな。
msgctxt "0001 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The windows up here are also barred with metal plates.\n"
"Not surprising, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. 脱出は難しいって事だね…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So escape still looks impossible..."
msgstr ""

#. だが念の為、我は他の場所の鉄板も
#. 調べておくとしよう…
msgctxt "0003 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But I'd better check all the other metal plates again,\n"
"just to be sure."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. この階にも完備されてるみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I\n"
"guess they're all over *this* floor, too...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 気にしてもしょうがない、放っておこう。
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's not much point in worrying about it now. I\n"
"should try to just forget about it..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここから出ても、
#. しばらくは監視カメラがトラウマになりそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Assuming I make it out of here alive, I'll never look\n"
"at surveillance cameras the same way again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間がわかったところで、
#. なんの意味もないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Knowing what time it is doesn't really help me at\n"
"all...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>相変わらず、この教室の窓にも
#. 鉄板のような物が打ち付けられている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just like everywhere else, the windows in this\n"
"classroom are all blocked off with pieces of metal.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>相変わらず、この教室の窓にも
#. 鉄板のような物が打ち付けられている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just like everywhere else, the windows in this\n"
"classroom are all blocked off with pieces of metal.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
